<p>You shed the outer layer of your mutated skin and empower it to act as a damage shield for 7 turns.</p><p>The shield can absorb up to <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">229, 308, 370, 422, 468</acronym> damage before it crumbles.</p><p></p>